01:27.380" end="01:27.560">This </span><span begin="01:27.560" end="01:27.710">love </span><span begin="01:27.710" end="01:27.830">is </span><span begin="01:27.830" end="01:27.890">a </span><span begin="01:27.890" end="01:28.220">blaze</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.220" end="01:29.750"><span begin="01:28.220" end="01:28.390">I </span><span begin="01:28.390" end="01:28.560">saw </span><span begin="01:28.560" end="01:28.730">flames </span><span begin="01:28.730" end="01:28.900">from </span><span begin="01:28.900" end="01:29.070">the </span><span begin="01:29.070" end="01:29.240">side </span><span begin="01:29.240" end="01:29.410">of </span><span begin="01:29.410" end="01:29.580">the </span><span begin="01:29.580" end="01:29.750">stage</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.750" end="01:31.730"><span begin="01:29.750" end="01:29.840">And </span><span begin="01:29.840" end="01:29.900">the </span><span begin="01:29.900" end="01:30.530">firebrigade </span><span begin="01:30.530" end="01:30.830">comes </span><span begin="01:30.830" end="01:30.950">in </span><span begin="01:30.950" end="01:31.010">a </span><span begin="01:31.010" end="01:31.310">couple </span><span begin="01:31.310" end="01:31.400">of </span><span begin="01:31.400" end="01:31.730">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.730" end="01:33.890"><span begin="01:31.730" end="01:32.060">Until </span><span begin="01:32.060" end="01:32.300">then </span><span begin="01:32.300" end="01:32.390">we </span><span begin="01:32.390" end="01:32.540">got </span><span begin="01:32.540" end="01:32.780">nothing </span><span begin="01:32.780" end="01:32.840">to </span><span begin="01:32.840" end="01:33.170">say </span><span begin="01:33.170" end="01:33.290">and </span><span begin="01:33.290" end="01:33.530">nothing </span><span begin="01:33.530" end="01:33.680">to </span><span begin="01:33.680" end="01:33.890">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.890" end="01:35.780"><span begin="01:33.890" end="01:34.